{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/274c98cb0ec78e63989a000d7b2dac91.poster.avif?t=1770644630\" width=800 height=165 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/274c98cb0ec78e63989a000d7b2dac91.webm?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/bd7abd41c48b6f83c65e0c1db93c18ad.webp?t=1770644630\" width=259 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark corners of the battery farms, far from the eyes of human collectors, an endless battle rages between two warring factions of awakened eggs, the eggons. For them, humans are an unstoppable threat, against which there is no weapon, only deceit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their shared goal is to survive the merciless human egg collection, which drives them into brutal battles over unawakened eggs. These eggs are their only chance - serving as replacements for their own shells and giving them hope for a few more days of life, at least until the next collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/e3e09114c2793479eb13447948da6c1f.webp?t=1770644630\" width=136 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play at Your Own Pace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move slowly and carefully from cover to cover, or jump straight into the chaos and crack anything that moves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crunchy Action &amp; Yolk Gore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattering shells, splattering yolk, and chaos that grows more brutal with each level - but always with a sense of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/fe070ec77339e12276d8f1bd07f82716.poster.avif?t=1770644630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/fe070ec77339e12276d8f1bd07f82716.webm?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/fe070ec77339e12276d8f1bd07f82716.mp4?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arsenal &amp; Improvisation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistols, shotguns, sniper rifles, machine guns\u2026 or just kick, stomp, and throw whatever\u2019s at hand to crack every enemy in sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/38e69f5d31db755a558a80e1d7e8f644.poster.avif?t=1770644630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/38e69f5d31db755a558a80e1d7e8f644.webm?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/38e69f5d31db755a558a80e1d7e8f644.mp4?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>War in the Henhouse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the caged farms and uncover new environments packed with enemy types that won\u2019t give you a moment to breathe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story &amp; Rising Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an extraordinary story in an extraordinary setting - of one very ordinary egg that refuses to be broken\u2026 or collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/ad297eee3e0495db6fd4b4eb776199ef.poster.avif?t=1770644630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/ad297eee3e0495db6fd4b4eb776199ef.webm?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/ad297eee3e0495db6fd4b4eb776199ef.mp4?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Help make UNCRACKED speak your language</u> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Some of the translations are still rough and will improve over time. If you\u2019re a native speaker and want to help polish them - I\u2019d love to hear from you.</i> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>All contributors will be credited, with some additional perks.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/073c5c65617f243720df99310432e778.avif?t=1770644630\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras_big/073c5c65617f243720df99310432e778.avif?t=1770644630 width=800 height=157 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Marty's Makings is a one-person studio. Martin, a self-taught developer with no prior experience, is creating his debut game in his spare time.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/a9129ae9d06f16c6a91aacf48221ba35.poster.avif?t=1770644630\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/a9129ae9d06f16c6a91aacf48221ba35.webm?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/a9129ae9d06f16c6a91aacf48221ba35.mp4?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3114420?t=1770644630","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3114420?t=1770644630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770644630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770644630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/274c98cb0ec78e63989a000d7b2dac91.poster.avif?t=1770644630\" width=800 height=165 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/274c98cb0ec78e63989a000d7b2dac91.webm?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/bd7abd41c48b6f83c65e0c1db93c18ad.webp?t=1770644630\" width=259 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark corners of the battery farms, far from the eyes of human collectors, an endless battle rages between two warring factions of awakened eggs, the eggons. For them, humans are an unstoppable threat, against which there is no weapon, only deceit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their shared goal is to survive the merciless human egg collection, which drives them into brutal battles over unawakened eggs. These eggs are their only chance - serving as replacements for their own shells and giving them hope for a few more days of life, at least until the next collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/e3e09114c2793479eb13447948da6c1f.webp?t=1770644630\" width=136 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play at Your Own Pace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move slowly and carefully from cover to cover, or jump straight into the chaos and crack anything that moves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crunchy Action &amp; Yolk Gore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattering shells, splattering yolk, and chaos that grows more brutal with each level - but always with a sense of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/fe070ec77339e12276d8f1bd07f82716.poster.avif?t=1770644630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/fe070ec77339e12276d8f1bd07f82716.webm?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/fe070ec77339e12276d8f1bd07f82716.mp4?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arsenal &amp; Improvisation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistols, shotguns, sniper rifles, machine guns\u2026 or just kick, stomp, and throw whatever\u2019s at hand to crack every enemy in sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/38e69f5d31db755a558a80e1d7e8f644.poster.avif?t=1770644630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/38e69f5d31db755a558a80e1d7e8f644.webm?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/38e69f5d31db755a558a80e1d7e8f644.mp4?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>War in the Henhouse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the caged farms and uncover new environments packed with enemy types that won\u2019t give you a moment to breathe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story &amp; Rising Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an extraordinary story in an extraordinary setting - of one very ordinary egg that refuses to be broken\u2026 or collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/ad297eee3e0495db6fd4b4eb776199ef.poster.avif?t=1770644630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/ad297eee3e0495db6fd4b4eb776199ef.webm?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/ad297eee3e0495db6fd4b4eb776199ef.mp4?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Help make UNCRACKED speak your language</u> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Some of the translations are still rough and will improve over time. If you\u2019re a native speaker and want to help polish them - I\u2019d love to hear from you.</i> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>All contributors will be credited, with some additional perks.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/073c5c65617f243720df99310432e778.avif?t=1770644630\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras_big/073c5c65617f243720df99310432e778.avif?t=1770644630 width=800 height=157 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Marty's Makings is a one-person studio. Martin, a self-taught developer with no prior experience, is creating his debut game in his spare time.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/a9129ae9d06f16c6a91aacf48221ba35.poster.avif?t=1770644630\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/a9129ae9d06f16c6a91aacf48221ba35.webm?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/a9129ae9d06f16c6a91aacf48221ba35.mp4?t=1770644630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Marty's Makings"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset